%F A392191 For odd n >= 1: a(n) = ((n - 1)/2) * n^2 = A084367((n - 1)/2) if n is an odd prime, and a(n) = 0 if n = 1 or n >= 9 is an odd composite. - _Gareth Montgomery_, Oct 29 2026
